فتدخل سينام الشركة وتعمل فيها، وتبدأ العديد من الأحداث في الوقوع.","description_en":"Sanem, a dreamy girl with hopes of becoming a famous writer, ends up working at an ad agency to avoid an arranged marriage. There, she meets her boss, Çan, and falls into a whirlwind of love and complications. Can she protect her heart while chasing her dreams?","description_fr":"Sanem est une jeune fille naturelle, joyeuse et vivante, contrairement à sa sœur aînée, Lale. Lorsque ses parents lui donnent le choix d’obtenir un emploi convenable ou un mariage arrangé, Sanem se précipite dans l’agence de publicité dans laquelle travaille sa sœur pour postuler...","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63jwFUMWkHeFOldEVfSp3VE0GNn.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uJ3HalVLkaOeH1lvDdrEmeqFxds.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":8.2,"vote_count":119,"age_rating":null,"year":"2018","release_date":"2018-06-26","runtime_minutes":120,"status":"Ended","country":"تركيا","language":"التركية","genres":["دراما","كوميديا","أوبرا صابونية"],"genre_keys":["drama","comedy","soap"],"similar":["tv284744","tv302063","tv215902","tv296140","tv102376","tv139471","tv52698","tv52645"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"Demet Özdemir","character":"Sanem Aydın","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2nOPPPxPjz11N1RcpDXiTiyDYv2.jpg"},{"name":"Can Yaman","character":"Can Divit","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qjDCqpngema0dqF1DDEbOKrXC1Z.jpg"},{"name":"Birand Tunca","character":"Emre Divit","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uRTNsnpW54W3VggQp6BJw0Ub4aF.jpg"},{"name":"Öznur Serçeler","character":"Leyla Aydın","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cW7R6D12Gltl07YdQT8gg5SjRaS.jpg"},{"name":"Ceren Taşçı","character":"Ayhan Işık","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/osj8CastVcLR4F1NLX62HctzIUQ.jpg"},{"name":"Sevcan Yaşar","character":"Aylin Yüksel","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z2lFS5bf3bEi9Ur6TwAyhhhOx2y.jpg"},{"name":"Anıl Çel